{"seq":5,"slug":"ab-testing-statistics","title":"A/B 测试统计方法","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics","rating":{"composite":3.87,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.39,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.5}},"introMarkdown":"# A/B 测试统计方法 简介\n\nA/B测试是数据驱动决策的黄金标准。通过随机对照实验，我们可以科学地评估产品变更、运营策略和算法优化的真实效果，避免被表面数据所误导。然而，一个设计不当的实验可能比不做实验更加危险，因为它会给人以科学决策的错觉。\n\n本知识库系统讲解A/B测试的统计理论基础和工程实践方法，面向数据科学家、产品经理和增长工程师。\n\n第1章**实验设计**建立实验设计的理论基础，介绍实验设计原则、样本量与统计功效的计算以及随机化方法的选择。\n\n第2章**统计方法**深入讲解A/B测试中的核心统计方法，涵盖假设检验、置信区间与效应量以及贝叶斯A/B测试方法。\n\n第3章**进阶实验**探讨超越简单A/B测试的高级实验方法，包括多变量测试、序贯检验和干扰与网络效应的处理。\n\n第4章**实验运营**聚焦实验的组织和文化建设，讲解实验平台架构、实验文化建设和常见陷阱的识别与规避。\n\n建议读者从第1章和第2章打好统计基础，再根据业务复杂度选择性学习第3章的进阶方法，最后通过第4章建立组织级的实验能力。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"experiment-design","title":"实验设计","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"experiment-design-principles","title":"实验设计原则","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/experiment-design-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sample-size-power","title":"样本量与统计功效","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/sample-size-power"},{"seq":3,"slug":"randomization-methods","title":"随机化方法","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/randomization-methods"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"statistical-methods","title":"统计方法","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/statistical-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hypothesis-testing","title":"假设检验","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/statistical-methods/hypothesis-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"confidence-intervals","title":"置信区间","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/statistical-methods/confidence-intervals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bayesian-ab-testing","title":"贝叶斯 A/B 测试","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/statistical-methods/bayesian-ab-testing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced-testing","title":"进阶实验","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/advanced-testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multivariate-testing","title":"多变量测试","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/advanced-testing/multivariate-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sequential-testing","title":"序贯检验","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/advanced-testing/sequential-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"interference-network-effects","title":"干扰效应与网络效应","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/advanced-testing/interference-network-effects"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"testing-operations","title":"实验运营","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"experimentation-platform","title":"实验平台架构","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/experimentation-platform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"experiment-culture","title":"实验文化","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/experiment-culture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"common-pitfalls","title":"常见陷阱","url":"/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/common-pitfalls"}]}]}